{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24837","headline":"题玄和师仙药室 · 杨衡","name":"题玄和师仙药室","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山边萧寂室，石掩浮云扃。\n遶室微有路，松烟深冥冥。\n入松汲寒水，对鹤问仙经。\n石几香未尽，水花风欲零。\n何年去华表，几度穷苍冥。\n却顾宦游子，眇如霜中萤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}